{"symbol":"GLOBTIER","yahoo":"GLOBTIER.BO","bse":null,"isin":null,"name":"Globtier Infotech Limited","sector":"Technology","industry":"Information Technology Services","website":"https://www.globtierinfotech.com","about":"Globtier Infotech Limited provides managed information technology (IT), SAP support, and custom application development services in India and internationally. It offers IT facilities management support services, such as IT service desk, cloud infrastructure support, end user support, infrastructure security and network management, and data centre and disaster recovery operations management services. The company also provides application support services, including application rollout, application management, and training and capacity building; and application development services, such as web app development, custom mobile app development, native and hybrid mobile app development, and Liferay for enterprises, as well as healthcare and life science sectors. In addition, it offers talent acquisition services comprising contractual hiring, permanent hiring, payroll management, fresher hiring, and hire-train-deploy services; and digital transformation services, including AI and automation, data analytics, business intelligence, and data visualization services. Further, the company provides cloud solutions, such as cloud consulting, managed cloud services, cloud migration, cloud implementation, cloud Finops, and cloud automation and DevOps; and information security services comprising cloud security, cybersecurity consulting, network security, data security, and managed security services. It serves small and medium-sized enterprises, organizations, and various industries. The company was founded in 2004 and is based in Noida, India.","updated":"2026-09-26T06:24:50+00:00","quote":{"price":16.34,"prevClose":15.57,"marketCap":24.71,"high52":36.5,"low52":13.51,"pe":20.95,"bookValue":30.2,"dividendRate":0.0,"roe":2.74,"shares":1.5121,"insiders":72.44,"instit